id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:p003","quote":"張王敖"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m017-0010","chapter_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:p017","quote":"張王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe","source_id":"s-shiji-048-chenshe","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:p007","quote":"武臣到邯鄲，自立為趙王，陳餘為大將軍，張耳、召騷為左右丞相。陳王怒，捕系武臣等家室，欲誅之。柱國曰：「秦未亡而誅趙王將相家屬，此生一秦也。不如因而立之。」陳王乃遣使者賀趙，而徙系武臣等家屬宮中，而封耳子張敖為成都君，趣趙兵亟入關。趙王將相相與謀曰：「王王趙，非楚意也。楚已誅秦，必加兵於趙。計莫如毋西兵，使使北徇燕地以自廣也。趙南據大河，北有燕、代，楚雖勝秦，不敢制趙。若楚不勝秦，必重趙。趙乘秦之獘，可以得志於天下。」趙王以為然，因不西兵，而遣故上谷卒史韓廣將兵北徇燕地。","source_term":"耳子張敖"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji048-001","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"agx_sqm_4ou"}},{"id":"agx_sqm_4ou_AA","label":"張偃（張耳陳餘列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"子偃","mention_ids":["c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0009"]},{"surface":"魯元王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0012","c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0027","c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0077"]},{"surface":"元王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0031"]},{"surface":"魯元王偃","mention_ids":["c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0098"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029","quote":"子偃"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029","quote":"魯元王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0027","chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029","quote":"魯元王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0031","chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029","quote":"元王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0077","chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger"